The pollen data come from the pollen radar of the Kleenex websites (kleenex.fr,
kleenex.co.uk, kleenex.nl, kleenex.com) and of Scottex in Italy (scottex.com),
brands of Kimberly-Clark. The widgets show the source of each reading.

The endpoints of the pollen radar were learned from the Home Assistant
integration kleenex_pollenradar by MarcoGos
(https://github.com/MarcoGos/kleenex_pollenradar). No file of it is included:
the readers of this project were written from recorded answers.

